CND ← {
    X ← ⍵
    a ← 0.31938153 ¯0.356563782 1.781477937 ¯1.821255978 1.330274429

    l ← |X
    k ← ÷1+0.2316419×l
    w ← 1 - (÷((2×(○1))*0.5)) × (*-(l×l)÷2) × (a +.× (k*⍳5))

    ((|0⌊×X)×(1-w))+(1-|0⌊×X)×w
}

⍝ S - current price
⍝ X - strike price
⍝ T - expiry in years
⍝ r - riskless interest rate
⍝ v - volatility

S ← 60
X ← 65
T ← 1
r ← 0.1
v ← 0.2

d1 ← { ((⍟S÷X)+(r+(v*2)÷2)×⍵)÷(v×⍵*0.5) }
d2 ← { (d1 ⍵) -v×⍵*0.5 }

⍝ Call price
callPrice ← { (S×CND(d1 ⍵))-(X×*-r×⍵)×CND(d2 ⍵) }

avg ← { (+/⍵) ÷ ⊃⍴ ⍵ }

⎕←avg callPrice¨ (⍳ 100000) ÷ 10000

⍝ Put price (not tested)
⍝ putPrice ← { (X×*-r×⍵)×CND(-d2 ⍵)-S×CND(-d1 ⍵) }

⍝ From https://github.com/melsman/apltail/blob/master/tests/blacksch.apl

⍝ ---------------------------------------------------------------
⍝ A small statistics workspace in Dyalog APL
⍝ ---------------------------------------------------------------
)CLEAR
]box on -style=max
⎕IO ← 1 ⋄ ⎕ML ← 1 ⋄ ⎕PP ← 10

prices ← 101.5 99.25 ¯3.5E2 104 1.5J2 ⍬
names ← 'apple' 'banana' "cherry"
greeting ← 'It''s a nice day'
matrix ← 3 4 ⍴ ⍳12

⍝ Dfns: guards, self-reference with ∇ and operands ⍺⍺ ⍵⍵
fact ← {⍵≤1:1 ⋄ ⍵×∇ ⍵-1}
mean ← {(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}
stddev ← {((+/(⍵-mean ⍵)*2)÷≢⍵)*0.5}
clamp ← {⍺⌈⍵⌊100}
pow ← {⍺⍺⍣⍵⍵⊢⍵}
both ← {(⍺⍺ ⍵)∧(⍵⍵ ⍵)}

⍝ Selection, set and structural functions
evens ← (0=2|⍳20)/⍳20
unique ← ∪ 3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6 5
common ← 1 2 3 ∩ 2 3 4
member ← 3 ∊ 1 2 3
found ← 'an' ⍷ 'banana'
sorted ← prices[⍋prices]
desc ← matrix[⍒matrix[;1];]
firstTwo ← 2↑names
rest ← 1↓names
flipped ← ⌽ matrix
upside ← ⊖ matrix
trans ← ⍉ matrix
joined ← matrix ⍪ 10 20 30 40
cat ← 1 2 , 3 4
boxed ← ⊂ 1 2 3
parts ← (1 1 0 1)⊆'abcd'
where ← ⍸ 0 1 0 1
encoded ← 2 2 2 ⊤ 5
decoded ← 2 ⊥ 1 0 1
running ← +\ ⍳10
colSum ← +⌿ matrix
rowScan ← +⍀ matrix
inverse ← ⌹ 2 2 ⍴ 4 7 2 6
same ← matrix ≡ matrix
diff ← matrix ≢ trans
keyed ← {⍺,≢⍵}⌸ 'mississippi'
ranked ← (+/⍤1) matrix
stencil ← {+/,⍵}⌺3 3 ⊢ matrix
swapped ← 2 -⍨ 10
atFn ← (10∘×)@2 4 ⊢ ⍳5
composed ← (-∘÷) 4
leftId ← 1 ⊣ 2
rightId ← 1 ⊢ 2
squad ← 2 ⌷ names
text ← ⍕ 3.14159
value ← ⍎ '1+2'
roll ← ? 6
deal ← 5 ? 49
fac ← ! 5
logic ← (1 0 1 ∨ 0 0 1) ∧ ~0 1 0
nand ← 1 ⍲ 1
nor ← 0 ⍱ 0
cmp ← (1<2) (2≤2) (3=3) (4≥1) (5>2) (6≠7)
shape ← ⍴ matrix
depth ← ≡ names
tally ← ≢ names
ns ← #.Stats
parent ← ##.config

⍝ Traditional function with locals, labels and control structures
∇ result ← Summarise data;total;i
  ⍝ Return mean, deviation and largest value
  total ← 0
  :If 0=≢data
      result ← ⍬
      →0
  :ElseIf 1=≢data
      result ← data data 0
      :Return
  :EndIf
  :For i :In data
      total +← i
  :EndFor
  :While total>1000
      total ÷← 2
  :EndWhile
  :Select ⊃data
  :Case 0
      ⎕←'starts with zero'
  :CaseList 1 2 3
      ⎕←'small start'
  :Else
      ⎕←'other'
  :EndSelect
  :Trap 11
      result ← (mean data)(stddev data)(⌈/data)
  :Else
      result ← ⎕DMX.Message
  :EndTrap
 done:
∇

:Class Account
    :Field Public Balance ← 0
    :Field Private Shared Count ← 0
    :Field Public Instance ReadOnly Owner ← ''

    ∇ make name
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      Owner ← name
      Count +← 1
    ∇

    ∇ Deposit amount
      :Access Public
      Balance +← amount
    ∇
:EndClass

acct ← ⎕NEW Account (⊂'Ada')
acct.Deposit 250
⎕←Summarise prices
⍞←'Enter a value: '
